sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as incident_response.py
    participant SE as Secure Endpoint
    participant SMA as Malware Analytics
    participant X as XDR
    participant I as ISE
    participant F as FMC
    participant U as Secure Connect (Umbrella API)
    P->>SE: GET /v1/computers, /v1/events
    SE-->>P: laptop GUID + MAC, file sha256
    P->>SMA: POST /api/v2/samples (file + api_key)
    SMA-->>P: poll /state → succ, /threat → score 95
    P->>X: OAuth token → inspect → enrich → respond
    X-->>P: observables Malicious + available actions
    P->>SE: PUT /v1/computers/{guid}/isolation
    P->>I: PUT /ers/config/ancendpoint/apply (Quarantine MAC)
    P->>F: token → host object → BLOCK rule → deploy
    P->>U: OAuth token → add domain to block destination list
    Note over SMA: analyses only, never blocks
